<title>ARGENTINA: RUGBY UNION-ENGLAND BEAT ARGENTINA 46-20 IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ENGLAND BEAT ARGENTINA 46-20 IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Argentina 46-20 (halftime 17-13) in the first rugby union test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Lisandro Arbizo, Gonzalo Quesada, Tomas Solari. Conversion: Quesada. Drop goal: Quesada.</p>
<p>England - Tries: Adedavo Adebayo (2), Mike Catt, Ben Clarke, Tony Diprose, Nick Greenstock. Conversions: Catt (5). Penalties: Catt (2)</p>
